      "text": "Trigger The doppelganger is transformed with Change Shape and another creature moves adjacent to it or takes a hostile action against it.\n\n---\n\nEffect The doppelganger reverts to its natural form and can make a Strike against the triggering creature. If the creature was unaware the doppelganger was in disguise, that creature is Off-Guard against this attack."
